 {
  "verse_id": "s19-v03",
  "song": "s19",
  "verse": 3,
  "final_english": "Knowing-doing-made knowing-frame, the self — in all ways High Lord alone may it be. A frame amid all these things — forsooth, be it not? What else then?",
